    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><em>You blur the sharpest edges of malice.</em></p><p>As an <strong>action</strong>, you can project a softening field of presence that lasts for <strong>1 minute</strong> and moves with you.</p><ul><li>During this time, any <strong>Intimidation (Presence) checks made against you or your allies</strong> within <strong>6 squares</strong> are made with <strong>disadvantage</strong>.</li><li>Creatures that begin their turn within 6 squares of you must succeed on a <strong>Soul check</strong> (DC = 8 + your tier + your Soul or Presence modifier, your choice when you gain this feature) or treat all hostile creatures as having <strong>half cover</strong> against their attacks until the start of their next turn, as their aggression slips.</li></ul><p>Soft Focus doesn’t end danger, but it makes cruelty harder to aim.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
